# Controls which models appear in the picker.
#
# One model ID per line. Blank lines and # comments are ignored.
# Browse https://openrouter.ai/models to find valid IDs.
#
# Delete this file to offer every OpenRouter model. Note that many of the
# hundreds of models available are not appropriate for chat.
#
# DEFAULT_MODEL (config.py, script.js, settings.js) must be listed here,
# or it cannot be selected. See "Model Selection" in the README.

